# Every Dockerfile in this repo COPYs the whole src/ (or client/) tree into
# its build stage rather than cherry-picking project references by hand —
# see the F4 README section for why. These are exactly the paths that
# shouldn't ride along: build output that a stale local build would
# otherwise leak into the image, and dependency caches the build stage
# reinstalls from scratch anyway.
**/bin/
**/obj/
client/node_modules/
client/dist/
client/.angular/
**/.vs/
**/.idea/
.git/
